AI models generated much of the Lean proof code under Bryan Ehrlich's
direction. Lean kernel checking applies to completed proofs. Open obligations
are marked with sorry and recorded in AUDIT.md. Daily proof exports include
the model, attempt identifier, base commit, and kernel-check result.

